{"id":"b8c5690725d651a3","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-razborov-smolensky.md","title":"Distinct Prime Modular Circuit Separation","display":"thm-razborov-smolensky — Distinct Prime Modular Circuit Separation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-razborov-smolensky","aliases":["28-thm-razborov-smolensky"],"display":"thm-razborov-smolensky — Distinct Prime Modular Circuit Separation","depends_on":["[[28-df-mod-m-circuit]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 14.4","source_printed_pages":"291","source_pdf_pages":"317","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-razborov-smolensky"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-razborov-smolensky</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-razborov-smolensky — Distinct Prime Modular Circuit Separation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"154f028fc8ad4b75\" href=\"?note=154f028fc8ad4b75\" title=\"28-df-mod-m-circuit\">28-df-mod-m-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 14.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"291"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"317"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked-proof-not-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\">\\(p,q\\)</span> 为不同素数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_p=\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*:\\sum_i x_i\\not\\equiv0\\pmod p\\}\">\\(L_p=\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*:\\sum_i x_i\\not\\equiv0\\pmod p\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec q=(q)\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}^{1}\">\\(\\vec q=(q)\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}^{1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec q)\">\\(\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec q)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"154f028fc8ad4b75\" href=\"?note=154f028fc8ad4b75\" title=\"28-df-mod-m-circuit\">28-df-mod-m-circuit</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\ne q\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ L_p\\notin\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\ne q\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ L_p\\notin\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格保留不同素数和单一MOD_q门种类；未推广到任意合数模数或全ACC0。教材只详细证明PARITY对MOD3的特例，本节点核对一般定理陈述，未重建全部证明，因此禁止作为已核验证明依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 14.4；印刷页 291；PDF 页 317。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第14章的 Distinct Prime Modular Circuit Separation，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-mod-m-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"154f028fc8ad4b75","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-mod-m-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-mod-m-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"154f028fc8ad4b75","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p,q$ 为不同素数；$L_p=\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*:\\sum_i x_i\\not\\equiv0\\pmod p\\}$；$\\vec q=(q)\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}^{1}$；$\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec q)$ 使用 [[28-df-mod-m-circuit]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p,q","display":false},{"tex":"L_p=\\{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*:\\sum_i x_i\\not\\equiv0\\pmod p\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec q=(q)\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec q)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\ne q\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ L_p\\notin\\operatorname{ACC}^0(\\vec q).","display":true}],"bytes":1549,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-347","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-mod-m-circuit]]、[[28-thm-razborov-smolensky]]、[[28-df-monotone-circuit]]、[[28-df-kw-relation]]、[[28-thm-kw-depth]]。"}],"outgoing":["154f028fc8ad4b75"]}